<!--
  Status-bar notification icon.

  Notification icons are rendered as a monochrome silhouette: the system keeps
  the alpha channel and discards colour, so this is drawn entirely in opaque
  white. A stock android.R.drawable was used before, which showed as a generic
  grey blob.
-->
